Description: Contains survey data collected in October 2020 from households 
    in Dowa and Thyolo Districts, Malawi. The dataset includes detailed 
    information on household sanitation practices, latrine infrastructure, 
    usage patterns, maintenance behaviors, and user preferences across rural 
    and peri-urban communities. Data was collected using the mWater survey 
    platform by BASEflow Malawi enumerators.
